WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.314
At the core is a conditional convolutional network,
a ResNet eighteen,

00:00:04.394 --> 00:00:08.834
that maps each face to a
one-hundred-twenty-eight-dimensional embedding.

00:00:08.914 --> 00:00:12.726
Training uses odd-one-out judgments: given a
triplet of faces,

00:00:12.806 --> 00:00:15.299
an annotator picks the least similar one.

00:00:15.379 --> 00:00:20.133
Each annotator is assigned a learnable gating mask,
passed through a sigmoid,

00:00:20.213 --> 00:00:24.652
that scales the importance of every embedding
dimension for that person.

00:00:24.732 --> 00:00:28.670
Similarity between two faces is the dot product of
their masked,

00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:29.988
rectified embeddings,

00:00:30.068 --> 00:00:36.202
and the model predicts the odd-one-out probability
directly from these three pairwise similarities.

00:00:36.282 --> 00:00:41.287
A sparsity and non-negativity penalty keeps the
dimensions few and interpretable,

00:00:41.367 --> 00:00:44.300
leaving only about twenty-two active dimensions.
